  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bist&#xE5;ndskredit tele, RS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Concessional Loan Telecom</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main objective is to assist in the reintroduction of interentity tele communications in BiH. This will be done by the supply of four transit/local exchanges, one local exchange and two international exchanges, to the Telecom Srpske. Total cost 34,5 MSEK (as a concessional loan). The project will be completed Sept-Nov 1999.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra telekommunikationerna mellan de b&#xE5;da bosniska entiteterna, inom RS och mellan RS och omv&#xE4;rlden. Detta g&#xF6;rs genom leverans av tv&#xE5; internationella stationer, fyra kombinerade transit/ lokal v&#xE4;xlar samt en lokalstation. Kostnad 34,5 MSEK (bist&#xE5;ndskredit),1/2 EVB och 1/2 INEC. Projektet klart sept-nov 1999.</narrative>
  </description>
